(test_feed.FeedTests.test_rename) ... ok\ntest_story_hidden_by_hand_leaves_feed (test_feed.FeedTests.test_story_hidden_by_hand_leaves_feed) ... ok\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 9 tests in 0.001s\n\nOK\n M src/app.py\n M tests/test_feed.py","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_019M8XYyvMVP5nseeY2UA1QL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
